                <pb facs="0474" n="360" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg360"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.7353b/86: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Portuguese Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Alte</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bar Harbor</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-06-24"><hi rendition="#italic">June 24,
                        1922</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 8:25 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>I did not fail to cable my Government the substance of your telegram of yesterday
                    in respect to cable concessions in the Azores.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alte</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
